# Themes

- Every styled component needs **both** `*.base.theme.ts` and `*.carbon.theme.ts`
- Import `*Theme` type from the sibling `.vue` file
- `classes` keys map to template slots/elements; use function form `({ props, slots, data }) => [...]`
- `styles` uses `colors.getPalette()`, `css()`, and CSS variables — follow `Button.base.theme.ts`
- Export default theme object; register in `themes/base/components.ts` and `themes/carbon/components.ts` with matching key name
- Global theme entries: `packages/ui/src/themes/base/index.ts`, `carbon/index.ts` (`classPrefix: 'x-'`)

When changing one theme variant, check whether the other variant needs the same logical change.

Reference: `packages/ui/src/components/button/theme/Button.base.theme.ts`
